  "comment:overrides": "expo-font pinned to the SDK-51 version: @expo/vector-icons declares 'expo-font: *', which let npm hoist the latest (55.x) to the top of node_modules, and the native build linked that against SDK-51's expo-modules-core (1.12.x) causing a Swift compile error (Color not conforming to AnyArgument). Forcing 12.0.10 keeps the hoisted copy compatible.",
  "overrides": {
    "expo-font": "~12.0.10"
  }
